<BaseLayout title="A small collection, chosen with care — Pocket Puzzle" description="About Pocket Puzzle and its handpicked collection of number, word, block and logic games." canonicalPath="/about/"><article class="legal-page"><h1>A small collection, chosen with care</h1><p>Pocket Puzzle is a place for a little mental detour: a number grid, a hidden word, or a satisfying connection.</p><p>Our first collection brings together six puzzles from HTMLGames. Choose a familiar Sudoku, explore a Nonogram, find words, connect islands, fit blocks or untangle traffic. Each game has a short original guide to help you begin.</p><h2>Games from their original provider</h2><p>Games run in the HTMLGames player. They may include advertising and provider controls. We keep the games and their attribution intact, and connect to the game player only after you choose Play.</p><p><a href="/copyright/">Read the game credits</a> or <a href="/#puzzles">find your next puzzle</a>.</p></article></BaseLayout>